WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,970
maybe we will leave

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:04,170
Or maybe we'll stay here forever

3
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:05,370
No matter how you say it

4
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:08,170
We can leave here and go to a whole new place

5
00:00:08,170 --> 00:00:09,770
Even if it's not the real world

6
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:11,170
It might also be safer

7
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:13,370
Have more opportunities to leave here

8
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:15,820
These words are there

9
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,220
As long as you're not in this damn place

10
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,220
Just look for the exit slowly.

11
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:24,660
Now the game is successful

12
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,260
Why is there no passage for us to go out?

13
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:31,480
Why is there no response yet? Waiting for Brother Lin

14
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:34,080
Are you really a prophet? No?

15
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:36,280
Why didn't the fat man die?

16
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,680
I have a special status so

17
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:42,080
This is a game that Brother Lin and I set up together

18
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:46,450
Brother Lin is really good at predicting things.

19
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:47,650
tidy up

20
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:48,650
Get ready to leave

21
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:50,380
There are no great men anymore

22
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,780
No need to be wary of each other

23
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:54,010
Have a good rest and wait for the exit
